MODULE: CheckpointAfterApplyCheckpointAhead
TARGET: CheckpointAfterApply
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: durable checkpoint claims an entry never applied
PERTURBS: CheckpointPersist

--- FIND
    /\ checkpoint' = applied /\ phase' = "snapshot"
--- REPLACE
    /\ checkpoint' = applied + 1 /\ phase' = "snapshot" \* MUTATION: unearned checkpoint.
--- END
